<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1473361577"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1528877901"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="dreamy night"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="LilyPichu"/><amll:meta key="album" value="dreamy night"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="04:02.273"><div begin="00:02.233" end="04:02.713"><p begin="00:02.233" end="00:06.924" itunes:key="L2161">1am, eyes closed, I'm slowly falling<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">凌晨一点，我闭上双眼</span></p><p begin="00:07.892" end="00:11.745" itunes:key="L2162">To the music and the atmosphere<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">任凭自己，缓缓坠入音乐世界</span></p><p begin="00:12.724" end="00:14.025" itunes:key="L2163">Now and then<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">恍惚间，包裹着我的灯光悄然褪色</span></p><p begin="00:14.035" end="00:17.513" itunes:key="L2164">I feel lights fading softly</p><p begin="00:17.523" end="00:18.955" itunes:key="L2165">All over me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">去年的记忆便涌上心头</span></p><p begin="00:18.965" end="00:21.964" itunes:key="L2166">And I remember last year</p><p begin="00:21.974" end="00:23.544" itunes:key="L2167">When I was<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我独自躺在床上</span></p><p begin="00:23.554" end="00:25.333" itunes:key="L2168">Alone in my bed</p><p begin="00:25.343" end="00:28.155" itunes:key="L2169">With all these thoughts in my head<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所有念头如乱麻般缠绕脑海</span></p><p begin="00:28.165" end="00:33.153" itunes:key="L2170">And living silently inside<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">又无声地停留体内，无人问津</span></p><p begin="00:43.412" end="00:47.953" itunes:key="L2171">It's so late in the night<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不知不觉，夜已深，我的意识也渐渐模糊</span></p><p begin="00:47.963" end="00:53.763" itunes:key="L2172">My mind is drifting away</p><p begin="00:53.773" end="00:58.275" itunes:key="L2173">Then I dream about times<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我无数次祈祷迎来一个崭新快乐的一天的场景在梦中浮现</span></p><p begin="00:58.285" end="01:04.185" itunes:key="L2174">I wished for a new, happier day</p><p begin="01:04.195" end="01:10.055" itunes:key="L2175">If a hand could reach out right now<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">彼时彼刻，我多希望有人能伸出援手</span></p><p begin="01:10.065" end="01:15.053" itunes:key="L2176">And save my life somehow<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无论用何种方法，将我的生活拯救</span></p><p begin="01:15.063" end="01:18.055" itunes:key="L2177">I'll face the sun again<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那么当微光破晓，我将微笑着面朝晨曦，目送这沉闷的永夜</span></p><p begin="01:18.065" end="01:22.284" itunes:key="L2178">As soon as this dreary night ends</p><p begin="01:29.253" end="01:31.084" itunes:key="L2179">Don't wanna go down like this<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可是，又有谁愿意此般低迷</span></p><p begin="01:31.094" end="01:34.193" itunes:key="L2180">My head's in a place that I don't miss<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的大脑似乎停留在一个我讨厌的世界里</span></p><p begin="01:34.203" end="01:35.545" itunes:key="L2181">So ugly<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这世界暴戾不堪又丑陋无比</span></p><p begin="01:35.555" end="01:36.533" itunes:key="L2182">So grumpy</p><p begin="01:36.543" end="01:39.535" itunes:key="L2183">Sleepin' in the meantime, just stay comfy<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我挥去所有想法，只管舒适地静静入眠</span></p><p begin="01:39.545" end="01:41.645" itunes:key="L2184">Once everything's said and done<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我知道我一旦说到做到，无论何事</span></p><p begin="01:41.655" end="01:44.175" itunes:key="L2185">I know I'll be okay, I will overcome<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会努力克服，最后安然无恙</span></p><p begin="01:44.185" end="01:45.023" itunes:key="L2186">I'm hoping<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">心怀希望，积极应对，我仍坚强地生活</span></p><p begin="01:45.033" end="01:45.615" itunes:key="L2187">I'm coping</p><p begin="01:45.625" end="01:46.465" itunes:key="L2188">I'm here<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">去年的记忆又涌上心头</span></p><p begin="01:46.475" end="01:47.713" itunes:key="L2189">I remember last year</p><p begin="01:47.723" end="01:51.384" itunes:key="L2190">When I was alone in my bed<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当我独自躺在床上</span></p><p begin="01:51.394" end="01:53.824" itunes:key="L2191">Unhappy thoughts in my head<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不愉快的想法占据整个脑海</span></p><p begin="01:53.834" end="01:59.073" itunes:key="L2192">And living silently inside<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">它们无声地停留体内，无人问津</span></p><p begin="01:59.083" end="02:01.853" itunes:key="L2193">Just keeping all to myself<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无人问津，将所有的烦恼都留给自己</span></p><p begin="02:01.863" end="02:04.733" itunes:key="L2194">Wished I could be somewhere else<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">多么期待我能去往一个无忧无虑的避风港</span></p><p begin="02:04.743" end="02:09.173" itunes:key="L2195">Back when I could only hide<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">多么希望我能回到只靠逃避就能解决一切的时光</span></p><p begin="02:09.183" end="02:13.813" itunes:key="L2196">It's so late in the night<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不知不觉，夜已深，我的意识也渐渐模糊</span></p><p begin="02:13.823" end="02:19.613" itunes:key="L2197">My mind is drifting away</p><p begin="02:19.623" end="02:24.315" itunes:key="L2198">Then I dream about times<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我无数次祈祷迎来一个崭新快乐的一天的场景又在梦中浮现</span></p><p begin="02:24.325" end="02:30.033" itunes:key="L2199">I wished for a new, happier day</p><p begin="02:30.043" end="02:36.045" itunes:key="L2200">If a hand could reach out right now<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">此时此刻，我多希望有人能伸出援手</span></p><p begin="02:36.055" end="02:40.875" itunes:key="L2201">And save my life somehow</p><p begin="02:40.885" end="02:43.773" itunes:key="L2202">I'll face the sun again<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那么当微光破晓，我将微笑着面朝晨曦，目送这沉闷的永夜</span></p><p begin="02:43.783" end="02:51.225" itunes:key="L2203">As soon as this dreary night ends</p><p begin="03:11.504" end="03:16.363" itunes:key="L2204">It's so late in the night<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不知不觉，夜已深，我的意识也渐渐模糊</span></p><p begin="03:16.373" end="03:22.225" itunes:key="L2205">My mind is drifting away</p><p begin="03:22.235" end="03:26.703" itunes:key="L2206">Then I dream about times<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我无数次祈祷迎来一个崭新快乐的一天的场景反复在梦中浮现</span></p><p begin="03:26.713" end="03:32.665" itunes:key="L2207">I wished for a new, happier day</p><p begin="03:32.675" end="03:38.355" itunes:key="L2208">If a hand could reach out right now<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">此时此刻，我多希望有人能伸出援手</span></p><p begin="03:38.365" end="03:43.233" itunes:key="L2209">And save my life somehow</p><p begin="03:43.243" end="03:46.173" itunes:key="L2210">I'll face the sun again<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那么当微光破晓，我将微笑着面朝晨曦，目送这沉闷的永夜</span></p><p begin="03:46.183" end="03:50.723" itunes:key="L2211">As soon as this dreary night ends</p><p begin="03:53.533" end="03:56.813" itunes:key="L2212">I'll face the sun again<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那么当微光破晓，我将微笑着面朝晨曦，目送这沉闷的永夜......</span></p><p begin="03:56.823" end="04:02.713" itunes:key="L2213">As soon as this dreamy night ends</p></div></body></tt>